MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainDialogue1NPC1NG+
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Wassup homie, you seem lost.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: And...weak, honestly.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: What? Don't give me that face homie, do you even know where you are?
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: "Bro, you don't even have a\u2014what the fuck? How the hell do you have
      that sword? Wait a sec, where is...how...? Well, shit. I don't have the slightest
      clue what's going on, but this saves me some time anyway.     "
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Since you have that sword, you certainly know it is magical, right? It
      absorbs certain components to make you stronger. Use it right and maybe you'll
      get the job done. Now for your lack of wits...I'm afraid that's beyond me.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Also, you definitely also know you should keep an eye out for the purple
      orbs enemies drop, they might come in handy.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Now, go kill those weak-ass bastard slimes.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'By the way, "I" opens your inventory and crafting table, "J" or "space"
      uses the sword, and "mouse" interacts with inventory and some other things. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: But of course you know this already since you stole my sword 'n all right.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Aight good luck!!!
